<%- include('partials/header') %>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-section eco4-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="animate__animated animate__fadeIn">ECO4 Grant Information</h1>
      <p class="animate__animated animate__fadeIn animate__delay-1s">Energy Efficiency Improvements for Your Home</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ECO4 Content -->
  <section class="eco4-content container mt-2">
    <div class="intro-text">
      <p>The ECO4 scheme is a government initiative designed to help reduce carbon emissions and tackle fuel poverty by improving the energy efficiency of homes across the UK. At Alhamra Builders, we are approved installers for the ECO4 scheme and can help eligible homeowners access funding for various energy-saving improvements.</p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- What is ECO4 -->
    <div class="eco4-section">
      <h2>What is the ECO4 Scheme?</h2>
      <p>ECO4 (Energy Company Obligation) is the latest phase of the government's long-running energy efficiency scheme, running from April 2022 to March 2026. It requires large energy suppliers to help improve the energy efficiency of domestic properties by installing various improvement measures.</p>
      <p>The scheme focuses on helping low-income, fuel-poor, and vulnerable households, making their homes warmer and reducing energy bills while also lowering carbon emissions.</p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Eligibility -->
    <div class="eco4-section mt-1">
      <h2>Who is Eligible?</h2>
      <p>ECO4 funding is primarily available to households that:</p>
      <ul class="eco4-list">
        <li>Receive certain benefits (such as Universal Credit, Pension Credit, or Child Tax Credits)</li>
        <li>Live in social housing with an EPC rating of D-G</li>
        <li>Live in properties with an EPC rating of E, F, or G (regardless of income in some cases)</li>
        <li>Are considered vulnerable to the effects of living in a cold home</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Additionally, some local authorities have their own eligibility criteria under the "ECO4 Flex" scheme, which may include households not receiving benefits but still considered to be in fuel poverty or vulnerable.</p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Available Measures -->
    <div class="eco4-section mt-1">
      <h2>Available Improvements</h2>
      <p>Through the ECO4 scheme, eligible households can access funding for various energy efficiency improvements, including:</p>
      <div class="measures-grid">
        <div class="measure-card">
          <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
          <h3>Cavity Wall Insulation</h3>
          <p>Filling the gap between your walls to prevent heat loss.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-card">
          <i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i>
          <h3>Loft Insulation</h3>
          <p>Adding or upgrading insulation in your loft space.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-card">
          <i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i>
          <h3>Solid Wall Insulation</h3>
          <p>Internal or external insulation for solid wall properties.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-card">
          <i class="fas fa-fire"></i>
          <h3>Heating System Upgrades</h3>
          <p>Replacing inefficient heating systems with more efficient alternatives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-card">
          <i class="fas fa-sun"></i>
          <h3>Renewable Technologies</h3>
          <p>Solar panels, heat pumps, and other renewable energy solutions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="measure-card">
          <i class="fas fa-door-open"></i>
          <h3>Doors & Windows</h3>
          <p>Energy-efficient doors and windows to reduce heat loss.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Our Process -->
    <div class="eco4-section mt-1">
      <h2>Our ECO4 Process</h2>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h3>Initial Assessment</h3>
          <p>We check your eligibility for the ECO4 scheme and discuss potential improvements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h3>Property Survey</h3>
          <p>Our qualified assessors conduct a detailed survey of your property to identify suitable measures.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h3>Funding Application</h3>
          <p>We handle the application process for ECO4 funding on your behalf.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <h3>Installation</h3>
          <p>Our experienced team installs the approved energy efficiency measures to the highest standards.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Benefits -->
    <div class="eco4-section mt-1">
      <h2>Benefits of ECO4 Improvements</h2>
      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <i class="fas fa-pound-sign"></i>
          <h3>Lower Energy Bills</h3>
          <p>Reduce your energy consumption and save money on your bills.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <i class="fas fa-thermometer-half"></i>
          <h3>Warmer Home</h3>
          <p>Enjoy a more comfortable living environment throughout the year.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
          <h3>Reduced Carbon Footprint</h3>
          <p>Help combat climate change by reducing your home's carbon emissions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
          <h3>Increased Property Value</h3>
          <p>Energy-efficient homes often command higher market values.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Call-to-Action Banner -->
  <section class="cta-banner mt-2">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Find out if you're eligible for ECO4 funding</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </div>
  </section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
